00:13:39.518 --> 00:13:42.288
built a complete agentic document intelligence pipeline

266
00:13:42.521 --> 00:13:46.725
that combines multiple AI technologies to understand complex documents.

267
00:13:47.159 --> 00:13:49.829
Together, these components form a hybrid system

